      <title>特斯拉Cybercab冲刺量产：一个快餐店细节，N个颠覆市场信号，投资者如何解读？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251103-%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89cybercab%E5%86%B2%E5%88%BA%E9%87%8F%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%BF%AB%E9%A4%90%E5%BA%97%E7%BB%86%E8%8A%82n%E4%B8%AA%E9%A2%A0%E8%A6%86%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%BB/</link>
